              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hugo: Hunt, Coord Attack and Extra Attack"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hugo's Gimmick is his Commence the Hunt\nCommence the Hunt in gained mainly from Hunting Instinct\nHunting Instinct gains Commence the Hunt from Skill/Upgrade card use\nFROM ALLIES, Unless you get Instinct 5 which adds his own cards too\nCommence the Hunt is an Extra Attack\nIt triggers whenever anyone on your team uses a Single Target Attack Card\nCommence the Hunt deals Additional damage based on the number of stacks\nTry to keep yourself at 5 stacks of Hunt, and slowly chip at it for max damage"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
